# Outcaster Trailblazer ruling: "entering the battlefield as a copy of another creature" is considered when determining whether the ability
# triggers. Phantasmal Image is a 0/0 card, but it enters as a copy of the Trailblazer, a 4/2, so the Trailblazer on the battlefield draws a
# card for it. The Image's copy has the enters trigger too (it adds a mana). The one Plains drawn joins the Plains Bot1 held (two in hand, one card gone from the library).

